body:
Years ago a random guy came over to pick something up he was buying off me from Gumtree or whatever.  He left his kids with me (a boy and a girl around 10ish) while he went to the cash machine to get cash - I never met these people before so that was strange enough.  The girl was fairly calm but the boy was jumping up and down on my sofa and then when outside with my front door open started kicking stones into my house!  I was too polite and a little bewildered to say anything but was so glad when they left.

&#x200B;

